{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T19:52:53",
      "utterance": "(本日は、お時間頂きありがとうございます。時間になりましたら、始めさせて頂きます。)",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T19:53:17",
      "utterance": "(宜しくお願い致します)",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:00:11",
      "utterance": "こんばんは。相談員です。はじめに、年齢・性別・相談内容をお伝え頂けますか。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:00:34",
      "utterance": "12歳、男、いじめられてます。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:01:28",
      "utterance": "教えてくれてありがとうございます。話せるところからで大丈夫です。どんなことが起こっていますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:01:53",
      "utterance": "悪口や無視される。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:02:21",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。それは辛いね。。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:02:28",
      "utterance": "うん。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:03:13",
      "utterance": "今は何年生なのかな？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:03:41",
      "utterance": "小学６年生だよ。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:04:30",
      "utterance": "そうなんだね。いつぐらいから、悪口や無視は始まったの？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:04:55",
      "utterance": "６年になってから。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:05:49",
      "utterance": "そっかあ。ずっと辛い事を我慢してきたんだね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:06:04",
      "utterance": "うん。そう。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:06:32",
      "utterance": "今日は勇気を持って相談に来てくれたんだね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:06:49",
      "utterance": "うん、そうだよ。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:07:43",
      "utterance": "一緒に考えていきたいと思います。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:07:58",
      "utterance": "うん、ありがと",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:08:43",
      "utterance": "あなたは、いじめられた時、どのような気持ちになるか教えてもらえるかな？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:09:04",
      "utterance": "寂しいし、悲しい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:10:13",
      "utterance": "ええ。そのように孤独を感じてつらいね。誰か周りで助けれくれる人はいるの？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:10:47",
      "utterance": "わからないけど、お母さんには心配かけたくない。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:12:00",
      "utterance": "うんうん。お母さんには言えてないんだね。それについては、本当はどう思っているの？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:12:31",
      "utterance": "お母さんは1人だから言いたくない。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:13:58",
      "utterance": "そうなのね。教えてくれてありがとう。お母さんを大事に思っているんだね。学校の先生には相談できそうかな？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:14:23",
      "utterance": "先生は好きじゃない。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:15:10",
      "utterance": "そうなのね。先生にはどんな気持ちがあるのか、良かったら教えてもらえるかな？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:15:40",
      "utterance": "いじめる奴らと仲がいいから。嫌い。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:17:03",
      "utterance": "どうしたらいい？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:17:11",
      "utterance": "そうだったんだね。そんな様子だと、嫌になるのも無理もなし、相談もしたくない気持ちになるよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:17:22",
      "utterance": "うん。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:17:29",
      "utterance": "悲しい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:17:55",
      "utterance": "うん。悲しいし、つらいね。今日は勇気を持って相談に来てくれたので、一緒にがんがえましょう。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:18:10",
      "utterance": "うん。ありがと",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:19:14",
      "utterance": "いじめが始まったころに、何かがあったりしたのかな？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:19:32",
      "utterance": "クラスが変わってから。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:20:21",
      "utterance": "なるほど。いじめてくる子たちとは、それまでどんな関係だったの？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:20:47",
      "utterance": "最初は仲良くしてたけど。わからない。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:22:18",
      "utterance": "そっかあ。特に何があったわけでもないから、よけいに寂しくなるし、くやしいね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:22:35",
      "utterance": "うん。悔しいよー！",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:23:11",
      "utterance": "そうだよね。心が痛くなるのを感じるよ。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:23:32",
      "utterance": "お昼休みや休憩時間は、どのように過ごしてるの？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:23:47",
      "utterance": "1人だよ。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:24:15",
      "utterance": "絵を描いてる。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:24:52",
      "utterance": "そっかぁ。絵を描いているとどんな気持ちなるの？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:25:08",
      "utterance": "悲しくなるよ。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:25:28",
      "utterance": "お父さんの絵を描くよ。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:26:02",
      "utterance": "どうしてお父さんの絵をかくのか、良かったら教えてもらえるかな？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:26:26",
      "utterance": "お父さん。天国にいたから。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:27:25",
      "utterance": "そうだったんだね。教えてくれてありがとう。お父さんの絵をかきながら、お父さんを思い出すと寂しくなるんだね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:27:43",
      "utterance": "うん。悲しい！",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:28:22",
      "utterance": "良い人は早く亡くなるの？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:29:07",
      "utterance": "お父さんは良い人だったんだね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:29:24",
      "utterance": "優しかった！",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:29:41",
      "utterance": "いつも遊んでくれたし。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:29:56",
      "utterance": "うん。うん。そうなんだ。素敵なお父さんだったんだね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:30:09",
      "utterance": "うん。ヒーロー！",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:30:28",
      "utterance": "すごいね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:30:38",
      "utterance": "凄いよ！",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:31:06",
      "utterance": "いてくれたら。助けてくれたのに。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:31:25",
      "utterance": "うん。そうだね。お父さん、かっこいいね。あなたは、お父さんのようにヒーローになりたいと思うのかな？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:31:51",
      "utterance": "僕は人に優しくしたい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:32:39",
      "utterance": "大人になってもイジメはあるの？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:32:43",
      "utterance": "うん。それも素敵だね。ヒーローは、優しいことも大事だと思うけどどうかな？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:32:51",
      "utterance": "大人もあるよ",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:33:01",
      "utterance": "そうか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:33:21",
      "utterance": "強くならないといけないのかな。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:33:42",
      "utterance": "あなたにとって、優しいってどんなことか、教えてもらえるかな？強いことと近いのかな？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:34:10",
      "utterance": "イジメられてる子がいたら。助けたい。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:34:44",
      "utterance": "同じ思い、わかるから。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:35:15",
      "utterance": "うん。うん。そうだね。気持ちがわかる事はとっても大事だと思う。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:35:30",
      "utterance": "うん。ありがと",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:35:47",
      "utterance": "優しいね。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:36:54",
      "utterance": "ありがとう。あなたは、今、すでに優しい気持ちをもっていると感じるよ。もし誰かがいじめられていたら、何て言ってあげたい？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:37:28",
      "utterance": "僕が守るよって。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:38:44",
      "utterance": "弱いからイジメられる。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:38:49",
      "utterance": "すばらしいよ。そして強いを思うんだけど、あなたはどう思うかな。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:39:17",
      "utterance": "今は弱いと感じているのかな？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:39:30",
      "utterance": "イジメられてる。から。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:40:08",
      "utterance": "イジメている人の事は強いと感じる？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:40:38",
      "utterance": "人とは思ってない。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:41:08",
      "utterance": "そうなのね。どのように思っているの？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:41:30",
      "utterance": "人間のくず。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:41:58",
      "utterance": "そのように思っているのね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:42:04",
      "utterance": "うん。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:42:31",
      "utterance": "だから。強くなればたおせるかな？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:42:53",
      "utterance": "そうかもしれないね。あなたは、どう思う？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:43:24",
      "utterance": "お父さんなら。倒せるよって言うと思う。",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:44:10",
      "utterance": "うん。うん。あなたはお父さんの子だから強くなれると思うよ",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:44:27",
      "utterance": "うん。そうだよね！",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:45:21",
      "utterance": "うん。うん。私は今日話していて、あなたはヒーローになれると思う。あなたは、倒したいって思う？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:45:41",
      "utterance": "うん。ぶっとばしたい！",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:45:51",
      "utterance": "そっかぁ！",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:46:02",
      "utterance": "うん！",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:46:28",
      "utterance": "がんばる。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:46:39",
      "utterance": "ぶっとばしたいという気持ちも自然だと思うよ",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:46:52",
      "utterance": "うん。",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:47:06",
      "utterance": "優しくて、強い倒し方ってどんなのがあると思う？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:48:13",
      "utterance": "かたとおとし",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:48:27",
      "utterance": "笑",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:48:37",
      "utterance": "わからない",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:48:39",
      "utterance": "かたとおとし？（笑）",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2023-12-21T20:48:48",
      "utterance": "(^^)",
      "distress_level": 0,
